            "title": "Ingredients with Purpose",
            "use_h1": true
          }
        },
        "text_jKVR6a": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Every ingredient in a Hemplucid formula exists for a specific, documented reason. Nothing is added for appearance, nothing for filler, and nothing because it’s inexpensive. <br/><br/>We select each component based on three criteria: does it serve a biological function, is it supported by published research, and can we verify its purity through <a href=\"/pages/quality-and-testing-the-lucid-guarantee\" target=\"_blank\">independent laboratory testing</a>?<br/><br/>This page explains what’s in our products, why it’s there, and how each ingredient contributes to the formula’s overall performance.</p><p>Formula-specific panels live on the product pages themselves, so the exact <a href=\"https://hemplucid.com/collections/cbd-tinctures\" target=\"_blank\">CBD tincture ingredients</a> in each bottle—extract type, carrier oil, potency—can be reviewed before you buy.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
