        "margin_top": 68,
        "margin_bottom": 68,
        "title": "Functional Ingredients: Mushrooms and Botanicals",
        "max_width": 94,
        "content": "<p>Our functional gummy line pairs cannabinoids with adaptogenic mushroom extracts—each selected for a specific use case:</p><p><strong>Reishi (Ganoderma lucidum): </strong> An adaptogenic mushroom with a long history of traditional use. Paired with CBD and CBN in our <a href=\"https://hemplucid.com/products/functional-gummies-sleep-cbd-cbn-mushroom\" target=\"_blank\">Sleep gummies →</a> to support nighttime calm.</p><p><strong>Lion’s Mane (Hericium erinaceus):</strong> Commonly discussed for cognitive support and focus. Featured in our <a href=\"https://hemplucid.com/products/functional-gummies-focus-cbg-mushroom\" target=\"_blank\">Focus CBG + Mushroom gummies</a>.</p><p><strong>Cordyceps (Cordyceps militaris):</strong>Traditionally associated with energy and endurance. Included in functional blends designed for daytime vitality.</p><p>Each mushroom extract is sourced from fruiting bodies—not mycelium grown on grain—to ensure the highest concentration of active beta-glucans and other bioactive compounds.</p>",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/functional_ingredients.png",
        "image_position": "left"
      }
    },
