        "show_tab": true,
        "tab_color": "#ffffff",
        "margin_top": 68,
        "margin_bottom": 68,
        "title": "USDA Organic Handler Certification",
        "max_width": 73,
        "content": "<p>HempLucid has held <a href=\"https://www.usda.gov/topics/organic\" target=\"_blank\">USDA Organic </a>Handler certification since 2020. This certification applies to our handling, processing, and packaging operations and requires compliance with the National Organic Program’s standards—including strict controls on prohibited substances, facility sanitation, and record-keeping.</p><p>For our <a href=\"https://hemplucid.com/collections/organic-cbd\" target=\"_blank\">organic product line</a>, this means: the hemp is cultivated in certified organic soil without synthetic fertilizers or prohibited pesticides, extraction methods comply with organic handling requirements, and the finished product is verified through our <a href=\"/pages/quality-and-testing-the-lucid-guarantee\" target=\"_blank\">third-party testing protocol</a>.</p><p>Organic certification verifies the process. Laboratory testing verifies the outcome. We maintain both.<br/><br/></p>",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/usda-organic-large.png",
        "image_position": "right"
      }
    },
